{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are not the hero. You don\u2019t explore. You don\u2019t fight. You watch.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your assignment continues\u2014this time in a deeper, colder section of the station. The rooms are different, the silence heavier. The anomalies haven\u2019t stopped. If anything, they\u2019ve grown bolder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Second Shift</strong>, the next entry in the <i>Observer Protocol</i> series. A minimalist surveillance horror experience where your only weapon is observation\u2014and failure means letting it in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flip between new camera feeds, scanning for increasingly strange and disturbing changes. Every mistake invites something closer. Every shift chips away at your certainty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What\u2019s hiding in the quiet? What\u2019s learning from your gaze?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new suite of eerie environments to monitor\u2014each with its own unsettling behavior</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deeper anomaly mechanics: some may react to how long you watch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Same no-combat, no-jump-scare philosophy\u2014just dread and deduction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Standalone experience, but part of the larger <i>Observer Protocol</i> storyline</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Shift Complete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3814930/91b201d7e4ece955e435883b0b5deefc78cd42aa.jpg"},{"name":"Flawless Execution","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3814930/6d11984d931ea46135f68921002a1c69940e6c64.jpg"},{"name":"First One\u2019s the Hardest","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3814930/3775e954f5611d8f4a240f4dd056573d9